12
01:07:30,000 --> 01:07:36,000
Mammoth is a 2006 American science fiction comedy horror television film
directed, co-written, and co-executive produced by Tim Cox.

13
01:13:07,500 --> 01:13:13,500
The film stars Vincent Ventresca, Summer Glau, Leila
Arcieri, Cole Williams, and Tom Skerritt.

14
01:18:45,000 --> 01:18:51,000
The film explores themes of mammoth, museum, alien life-form.

15
